@startuml SD_US105
autonumber
title Sequence Diagram - US105: Update Aircraft Operational Status

actor "ATCC" as Actor
participant "Postman / UI" as UI
box "AISafe Backend (Spring Boot)" #LightCyan
participant "AircraftController" as Ctrl
participant "UpdateAircraftStatusDTO" as DTO
participant "AircraftService" as Service
participant "AircraftRepository" as Repo
participant "Aircraft" as Domain
end box
database "H2 Database" as DB

Actor -> UI: Inputs registration number and new status (e.g., UNDER_MAINTENANCE)
activate UI

UI -> Ctrl: PATCH /api/aircrafts/{registrationNumber} (JSON)
activate Ctrl

Ctrl -> DTO**: creates and @Validates
activate DTO
DTO --> Ctrl: dto
deactivate DTO

Ctrl -> Service: updateAircraftStatus(registrationNumber, dto.status)
activate Service

Service -> Repo: findByRegistrationNumber(registrationNumber)
activate Repo
Repo -> DB: SELECT * FROM aircraft WHERE registration_number = ?
activate DB
DB --> Repo: Aircraft record
deactivate DB
Repo --> Service: aircraft Entity
deactivate Repo

Service -> Domain: updateStatus(newStatus)
activate Domain
note right of Domain: Business rule validation\n(e.g., checking valid transitions)
Domain --> Service: success
deactivate Domain

Service -> Repo: save(aircraft)
activate Repo
note right of Repo: Optimistic Locking active\n(checks @Version field)
Repo -> DB: UPDATE aircraft SET status = ?, version = version + 1 WHERE ...
activate DB
DB --> Repo: Returns updated entity
deactivate DB
Repo --> Service: updatedAircraft
deactivate Repo

Service --> Ctrl: updatedAircraft
deactivate Service

Ctrl --> UI: 200 OK (JSON representation)
deactivate Ctrl

UI --> Actor: Displays Success Message & Updated Details
deactivate UI

@enduml